{"ocrText": "81\nSPEECH  AT  A  MEETING  OF  PETROGRAD  COMMITTEE  R.S.D.L.P.(B.)\nvery strong, and in the rear there is the high cost of living,\neconomic  dislocation  and  so  on.\nThe Central Committee does not want to force your deci-\nsion. Your right, the right to protest against the actions of\nthe Central Committee, is a legitimate one, and your deci-\nsion  must  be  a  free  one.\nFirst  published  in  1923,\nPublished  according  to\nin  Krasnaya  Letopis  No.  9\nthe  minutes  of  the  meetings\nof  the  Petrograd  Committee\nof  the  R.S.D.L.P.(B.),  1917", "textLayer": [{"text": "81", "x": 86.76, "y": 6.06, "w": 2.13, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "SPEECH  AT  A  MEETING  OF  PETROGRAD  COMMITTEE  R.S.D.L.P.(B.)", "x": 12.77, "y": 6.11, "w": 70.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "very strong, and in the rear there is the high cost of living,", "x": 8.89, "y": 9.53, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "economic  dislocation  and  so  on.", "x": 8.89, "y": 11.47, "w": 42.25, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "The Central Committee does not want to force your deci-", "x": 11.67, "y": 13.39, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "sion. Your right, the right to protest against the actions of", "x": 8.89, "y": 15.33, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the Central Committee, is a legitimate one, and your deci-", "x": 8.89, "y": 17.27, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "sion  must  be  a  free  one.", "x": 8.89, "y": 19.2, "w": 32.35, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "First", "x": 10.46, "y": 23.08, "w": 4.65, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "published", "x": 16.03, "y": 23.08, "w": 9.26, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "in", "x": 26.19, "y": 23.08, "w": 1.84, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1923", "x": 28.95, "y": 23.13, "w": 4.26, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 33.42, "y": 23.08, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Publish